  "summary": "The paper proposes two simulator-based hybrid quantum time-series models, QNN and HQNN, evaluated on four benchmarks: Mackey-Glass, Lorenz, Box-Jenkins, and USD/EUR. Reported best results include QNN RMSE 0.01360 on Mackey-Glass and 0.00281 on USD/EUR, while classical baselines remain competitive or better on several tasks, such as LSTM on Box-Jenkins (RMSE 0.64989) versus HQNN (0.69741) and QNN (1.62488).",
